### [Apps] Get app details by name (read-only)
GET {{api-server}}/v2/apps/open-bos HTTP/1.1
X-Api-Key: {{read-only-token}}

### [Apps] Update app properties (read–write)
PATCH {{api-server}}/v2/apps/open-bos?registered=true&version=v1.1.0 HTTP/1.1
X-Api-Key: {{read-write-token}}

### [Apps] Get details for a specific patch (read-only)
GET {{api-server}}/v2/apps/open-bos/patches/2.0.0 HTTP/1.1
X-Api-Key: {{read-only-token}}

### [Apps] Update patch with additional query parameter (read–write)
PATCH {{api-server}}/v2/apps/open-bos/patches/2.0.0?apply=true HTTP/1.1
X-Api-Key: {{read-write-token}}